  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New Features & Enhancements\nCollection Mapping Support: Introduced the ability to map collections (List<T>, T[], and other IEnumerable<T> implementations) seamlessly using the MapTo<T> extension method.\nAutomatic Element Mapping: Each item in a source collection is individually mapped to the corresponding destination type, ensuring deep transformation support.\nFlexible Destination Types: Supports mapping to arrays, generic lists, and collections with constructors accepting IEnumerable<T>.\nReflection-Based Mapping: Uses dynamic reflection to apply the appropriate MapTo<T> transformation to each element in the collection.",
